  "overview": "**SEED Design System** is a light-first design system anchored on `#fff` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.7:1 contrast) and `#f60` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `System UI` (72px display down to 16px body), unified by `20px` base corner radius and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nMaintained by **Daangn**. Source: published token package (https://github.com/daangn/seed-design), repo https://github.com/daangn/seed-design. Inventory: **91** colors, **33** typography steps, and **56** documented components (see repository license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 56 component tokens with documented paddings: `0`, `10px 14px`, `6px 10px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#f7f8f9` cards; separate sibling sections using `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`inset 0 -1px #00000010`, `inset 0 0 0 1px #000f3323`) paired with `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#f60` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#fff` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#f60` with `#f7f7f8` text (2.7:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `System UI` headings with `System UI` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `20px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (20px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#f7f8f9` surface shifts and `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `20px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `seed-field-label` fields and secondary buttons."
